/* AMBER's break-trigger: this turn simply cannot bust. Checked before
   anything is cleared, so the turn continues untouched - and BEFORE the bust
   EVENT below, which is the half that was wrong. famFire('bust') is what pays
   Retort, Reprisal, slow_cook and fools_gold; firing it two lines above this
   check meant every one of them collected on a bust that never happened,
   while the player kept the turn AND its points. A turn Amber says cannot
   bust has to look that way to the cards listening for one. */
if(G._bustImmuneTurn){
  try{setStatusMsg('AMBER HOLDS — NO BUST','gold');famLog('AMBER — THE TURN SURVIVES');}catch(e){}

